WEBVTT

00:34.360 --> 00:35.960
In the World Beyond,

00:36.360 --> 00:38.400
humans take Potions

00:39.120 --> 00:41.520
to gain various Beyonder powers

00:41.800 --> 00:44.560
and advance to higher Sequences
in a Pathway.

00:46.080 --> 00:48.360
All 22 Pathways

00:48.760 --> 00:50.680
begin from Sequence 9,

00:51.480 --> 00:53.320
and the lower the Sequence number is,

00:53.840 --> 00:56.120
the stronger the Beyonder powers.

00:57.360 --> 00:59.000
A High-Sequence Beyonder

00:59.560 --> 01:02.720
can possess powers
comparable to a deity.

01:03.760 --> 01:06.360
And such Pathways

01:07.360 --> 01:09.600
are Pathways to Divinity.

01:16.883 --> 01:19.840
(Zouteland Theater)

01:25.320 --> 01:26.800
(Gathering of Alfalfa survivors and families)
♪Alfalfa♪

01:26.800 --> 01:28.400
♪Got lost♪

01:28.400 --> 01:31.680
♪In the raging sea♪

01:32.360 --> 01:33.240
♪Betrayal♪

01:33.240 --> 01:34.120
♪Slaughter♪

01:34.120 --> 01:36.600
♪No justice weighs the scale's decree♪

01:36.880 --> 01:39.360
♪Only greed and depravity♪

01:39.560 --> 01:43.120
♪The siren's foul curse♪

01:43.560 --> 01:45.800
♪Wretched souls♪

01:47.480 --> 01:49.800
♪Become the demon's fee♪

01:50.208 --> 01:52.640
♪Skulls as beacons on the mast♪

01:52.736 --> 01:53.600
♪Chaos♪

01:53.600 --> 01:54.480
♪Bloodshed♪

01:54.480 --> 01:55.720
♪Souls smelted into♪

01:55.720 --> 01:57.040
♪Purgatory's flames♪

01:59.480 --> 02:01.840
♪Blood streams on the deck♪

02:01.840 --> 02:04.720
♪Redder than the crimson west♪

02:06.480 --> 02:10.480
♪Deliver us from♪

02:10.480 --> 02:13.000
♪This plight♪

02:14.040 --> 02:14.880
Sorry.

02:18.240 --> 02:21.640
♪Brave warrior Tris♪

02:21.720 --> 02:24.160
♪Descended from skies♪

02:24.680 --> 02:26.160
♪Radiant as the sun♪

02:26.160 --> 02:27.440
♪Urging folks to rebel♪

02:27.440 --> 02:29.400
♪Sailing through the stormy swell♪

02:29.800 --> 02:33.240
♪The sun rises anew♪

02:33.240 --> 02:36.080
♪Seagulls sing their song♪

02:36.080 --> 02:37.680
♪The heroes' brave deeds♪

02:37.680 --> 02:42.280
♪Carried on and long♪

03:05.440 --> 03:06.304
Captain,

03:06.520 --> 03:07.640
didn't you see Ms. Daly off?

03:08.640 --> 03:10.528
HQ sent escorts
for Antigonus Family's Notebook

03:10.528 --> 03:11.485
to Backlund.

03:12.160 --> 03:13.240
Ms. Daly joined them.

03:15.120 --> 03:16.120
You haven't recovered?

03:17.320 --> 03:18.320
I need more time.

03:19.160 --> 03:20.800
I'm grateful I wasn't contaminated.

03:21.360 --> 03:23.760
That Hanged Man's spiritual shock
overwhelmed me.

03:24.960 --> 03:25.824
According to records,

03:26.292 --> 03:27.136
the True Creator

03:27.136 --> 03:29.600
is an evil being worshiped
by organizations like Aurora Order.

03:30.240 --> 03:31.360
It matches your description

03:31.880 --> 03:32.920
but is very different.

03:34.440 --> 03:35.960
It's a pity Vincent died in the dream.

03:36.760 --> 03:38.080
Otherwise we could've found more.

03:45.844 --> 03:48.704
=Episode 5=
(Hero: Losing Oneself Brings Agony)

03:55.080 --> 03:56.280
Behind the Alfalfa Tragedy,

03:56.920 --> 03:57.800
there's another truth?

03:58.360 --> 03:59.440
Yes, Captain.

04:01.280 --> 04:03.264
(One week ago, Divination Club)
I want a divination regarding my fiancé.

04:04.120 --> 04:05.280
The Alfalfa he boarded

04:05.760 --> 04:07.040
began returning over a month ago

04:07.600 --> 04:08.840
but hasn't reached port yet.

04:09.480 --> 04:11.280
(Joyce Meyer's current condition.)

04:30.080 --> 04:32.000
This might be the intuition of a Seer.

04:33.184 --> 04:34.040
Actually,

04:34.040 --> 04:35.000
after your report,

04:35.640 --> 04:37.320
the Nighthawks
also received related info.

04:38.200 --> 04:39.440
But we need new leads.

04:47.840 --> 04:48.800
Thank you.

04:49.040 --> 04:49.880
Thank you.

04:49.880 --> 04:50.760
Mr. Tris,

04:51.640 --> 04:53.040
thank you for saving my husband.

04:53.880 --> 04:55.320
I'm glad your husband is safe.

05:07.456 --> 05:08.320
Mr. Klein.

05:09.472 --> 05:10.336
Meyer,

05:10.800 --> 05:11.800
this is the Seer,

05:11.800 --> 05:12.640
Mr. Klein.

05:13.440 --> 05:15.160
He was the one
who divined your safe return.

05:18.016 --> 05:18.880
Mr. Meyer,

05:19.720 --> 05:21.360
are you bothered by something?

05:26.120 --> 05:27.520
(Citrine Room)
After I left Alfalfa,

05:28.480 --> 05:30.880
I've been having
the same nightmare every night.

05:32.160 --> 05:33.480
It feels so real.

05:33.960 --> 05:35.120
I'm terrified.

05:35.520 --> 05:36.720
Stay calm, Mr. Meyer.

05:37.840 --> 05:39.000
Let me see your dream.

06:10.280 --> 06:12.080
Why did you try to save that Barbarian?

06:12.520 --> 06:14.600
He was the last surviving Barbarian.

06:15.200 --> 06:16.400
I needed to ask him

06:17.080 --> 06:19.880
why they suddenly
committed such atrocities.

06:20.440 --> 06:22.200
There was no discernible reason.

06:22.520 --> 06:23.424
It was bizarre.

06:23.760 --> 06:25.080
Utterly bizarre.

06:25.680 --> 06:27.160
Perhaps you observed certain details

06:27.456 --> 06:28.480
but overlooked them.

06:29.360 --> 06:30.360
They tried to tell you

06:30.760 --> 06:31.720
the true mastermind.

06:46.080 --> 06:46.976
(This is...)

06:48.240 --> 06:50.400
Hornacis. Flegrea.

06:50.400 --> 06:52.120
Hornacis. Flegrea.

06:52.120 --> 07:01.240
Hornacis.

07:03.600 --> 07:04.920
(Hornacis again.)

07:05.760 --> 07:06.880
(How many times is this?)

07:09.800 --> 07:11.080
(Why does it keep haunting me?)

07:12.480 --> 07:14.240
(Could it be
an evil deity's temptation?)

07:14.920 --> 07:15.840
(That palace)

07:16.760 --> 07:18.560
(holds clues about my transmigration?)

07:20.520 --> 07:21.568
(I hope Mr. Azik)

07:21.568 --> 07:23.776
(can find the information
and write to me soon.)

07:25.680 --> 07:26.960
(Hornacis...)

07:33.184 --> 07:34.048
Captain.

07:34.144 --> 07:34.984
How is it?

07:36.080 --> 07:37.760
The tragedy's creator was present.

07:38.720 --> 07:39.920
He manipulated all survivors

07:40.400 --> 07:41.680
into accepting his new identity.

07:42.976 --> 07:43.816
It's the hero,

07:44.384 --> 07:45.248
Tris.

07:49.216 --> 07:50.120
This alone

07:51.040 --> 07:53.160
can't convict a recognized hero.

07:54.040 --> 07:55.320
We need concrete proof.

07:56.320 --> 07:57.560
I'll request a joint probe.

08:00.800 --> 08:03.080
We need Mandated Punishers
and Machinery Hivemind's help.

08:06.548 --> 08:09.504
(Lord of Mysteries)

08:10.932 --> 08:15.712
(Demoness Sect)

08:36.600 --> 08:39.480
Getting worshiped
by victims and their families,

08:41.240 --> 08:42.840
you're loving this, huh?

08:47.280 --> 08:49.800
Persuading loving husbands
to kill each other.

08:50.960 --> 08:52.960
Then awakening in their widows' arms.

08:53.800 --> 08:55.840
(Tris, Sequence 8: Instigator, Assassin Pathway)
What could surpass this ecstasy

08:56.440 --> 08:57.360
and fulfillment?

08:58.800 --> 08:59.648
I believe

09:00.120 --> 09:01.680
I'm ready for promotion.

09:02.360 --> 09:03.240
In Tingen,

09:03.520 --> 09:05.160
you must complete one more task.

09:07.720 --> 09:10.720
Your original accomplice
is in Nighthawks' sight,

09:11.560 --> 09:13.240
so you have to work alone.

09:15.000 --> 09:16.480
Here's the advance payment for you.

09:17.760 --> 09:19.680
Potion formula of Sequence 7.

09:21.720 --> 09:22.592
Witch.

09:33.043 --> 09:38.976
(Bar)

09:38.976 --> 09:39.840
Mr. Neil,

09:40.480 --> 09:41.984
I need materials for Benson

09:41.984 --> 09:42.945
and Melissa's talismans,

09:43.800 --> 09:44.672
not liquor.

09:46.280 --> 09:47.360
Be patient,

09:47.440 --> 09:48.360
young man.

09:48.768 --> 09:49.632
Follow me.

10:22.600 --> 10:23.880
Welcome

10:24.360 --> 10:27.080
to Tingen's underground market.

10:31.956 --> 10:34.592
(Tingen's Underground Market)

10:47.400 --> 10:48.360
Impressive selection.

10:50.200 --> 10:51.400
Naturally.

10:51.800 --> 10:53.720
There are many Beyonder ingredients too.

10:53.856 --> 10:54.760
People who come here

10:54.760 --> 10:57.160
aren't just Mysticism dabblers.

10:58.040 --> 11:00.000
The authorities
permit such an underground market?

11:01.280 --> 11:02.720
Channeling is better than blocking.

11:03.160 --> 11:05.880
Church of the Lord of Storms'
Mandated Punishers watch the dock area.

11:06.080 --> 11:08.680
They've always turned a blind eye.

11:12.080 --> 11:13.560
(He has strong spiritual waves.)

11:19.800 --> 11:20.880
Death.

11:21.640 --> 11:23.040
The smell of death.

11:25.240 --> 11:26.080
Death!

11:26.440 --> 11:27.840
The smell of death!

11:28.440 --> 11:29.440
Don't mind him.

11:29.880 --> 11:31.040
His nickname is Monster.

11:31.280 --> 11:32.760
He's always been spiritually aware.

11:33.080 --> 11:34.760
Rambling is normal for him.

11:34.912 --> 11:35.776
(So)

11:36.640 --> 11:37.600
(he knows)

11:37.840 --> 11:38.920
(I returned from death?)

11:45.152 --> 11:46.016
We're here.

11:46.280 --> 11:47.320
They sell talismans here.

11:47.960 --> 11:49.568
Back again, Old Neil?

11:50.185 --> 11:52.064
Spring Water of the Spring of the Elves
is here.

11:52.160 --> 11:53.320
Did you bring money?

11:53.520 --> 11:54.400
Next time.

11:54.640 --> 11:55.680
For sure.

11:56.280 --> 11:57.840
The misfortune-warding effect is slim.

11:58.680 --> 12:00.160
After all, they're not Beyonders.

12:00.520 --> 12:02.520
They can't make
real protective talismans.

12:03.080 --> 12:05.400
Get two prototypes to process ourselves.

12:05.632 --> 12:06.480
Well...

12:06.480 --> 12:07.600
Even they cost so much?

12:08.320 --> 12:09.680
I'll have to expense this somehow.

12:11.280 --> 12:12.800
You have potential.

12:18.520 --> 12:19.720
A sharp eye, sir.

12:20.080 --> 12:22.000
This is Emperor Roselle's rune.

12:22.480 --> 12:23.560
Legend says this rune

12:23.720 --> 12:25.280
possesses miraculous power.

12:25.640 --> 12:28.040
It'll surely avert disasters for you.

12:29.720 --> 12:30.880
No, thanks.

12:31.680 --> 12:32.520
Trust me.

12:32.520 --> 12:34.240
This definitely won't avert disasters.

12:35.440 --> 12:36.440
I'll take those two.

12:36.720 --> 12:38.520
Is this really Roselle's rune?

12:38.840 --> 12:39.760
Got any Shadow Lizards?

12:39.928 --> 12:40.768
No.

12:43.328 --> 12:44.192
(Tris?)

12:55.048 --> 12:55.968
Got any Shadow Lizards?

13:04.320 --> 13:05.216
He's being followed.

13:06.400 --> 13:07.960
The Mandated Punishers' informants.

13:35.264 --> 13:36.160
Head over there.

13:42.440 --> 13:43.360
Cunning rat.

13:43.360 --> 13:44.200
Block him!

14:02.720 --> 14:03.584
Captain.

14:05.760 --> 14:06.800
Has Tris escaped?

14:08.480 --> 14:09.376
We're late.

14:09.920 --> 14:10.784
Come with me.

14:11.040 --> 14:12.360
We need your divination.

14:20.720 --> 14:21.640
So we've found

14:21.640 --> 14:23.040
evidence of Tris's crimes?

14:23.760 --> 14:25.080
The Mandated Punishers found it.

14:26.040 --> 14:27.680
It also revealed cases in nearby cities.

14:28.920 --> 14:30.480
The official assessment shows,

14:31.160 --> 14:32.480
Assassin Pathway's Sequence 8,

14:32.704 --> 14:33.568
Instigator.

14:34.400 --> 14:35.240
(Instigator?)

14:36.320 --> 14:38.080
(They excel at stirring evil desires)

14:38.680 --> 14:39.552
(and conflicts.)

14:41.160 --> 14:43.120
(No wonder the Alfalfa
suffered such a tragedy.)

14:43.872 --> 14:44.768
Go straight.

14:49.240 --> 14:51.280
The Assassin Pathway
links to the Demoness Sect.

14:52.200 --> 14:53.920
He must have to Tingen
for something else.

14:54.760 --> 14:56.880
We've started a joint investigation
throughout Tingen.

14:58.080 --> 14:58.976
The Demoness Sect?

14:59.840 --> 15:01.880
It's an evil organization
that spreads disasters.

15:02.280 --> 15:04.720
They worship a hidden entity
called the Primordial Demoness.

15:05.408 --> 15:06.432
Also, their upper echelon

15:06.995 --> 15:07.855
are all female.

15:10.528 --> 15:11.368
Here we are.

15:11.760 --> 15:12.920
The divination points here.

15:19.360 --> 15:20.200
Stay here.

15:21.840 --> 15:23.200
Assassin Pathway's higher potions

15:23.320 --> 15:24.560
seem more suitable for females.

15:25.680 --> 15:26.720
That Mr. Tris has

15:26.800 --> 15:27.760
a worrying future ahead.

15:30.480 --> 15:31.800
Official duty. Please cooperate.

15:32.200 --> 15:33.040
Leave now.

15:37.280 --> 15:38.600
I-I'm sorry.

15:39.200 --> 15:40.120
Hurry and leave.

15:40.120 --> 15:41.080
Don't linger here.

15:42.200 --> 15:43.720
Miss, do you need help?

15:45.040 --> 15:46.120
N-No, I don't.

15:47.000 --> 15:48.120
I'm just feeling unwell.

15:48.480 --> 15:49.560
I'm about to see a doctor.

16:11.360 --> 16:12.600
(Wanted Notice)
(Tris has vanished into thin air.)

16:13.520 --> 16:15.456
(Three Beyonder organizations
and the police)

16:15.456 --> 16:16.593
(jointly searched for days.)

16:17.720 --> 16:18.600
(Then they declared)

16:18.600 --> 16:19.560
(the search a failure.)

16:22.200 --> 16:23.080
(After that incident,)

16:23.455 --> 16:25.060
(Holy Cathedral granted my application.)

16:25.376 --> 16:26.656
(My weekly pay hits six pounds.)

16:27.680 --> 16:29.240
(What could be better than a raise?)

16:30.280 --> 16:31.160
(I visit the club)

16:31.160 --> 16:32.280
(several times a week.)

16:33.040 --> 16:34.272
(The potion is digested well.)

16:35.400 --> 16:36.400
(As for the Tarot Club,)

16:37.280 --> 16:39.200
(since the Fool's threefold honorific
was tested)

16:39.440 --> 16:40.520
(and I responded,)

16:41.240 --> 16:42.480
(Mr. Hanged Man's mentality)

16:42.600 --> 16:44.160
(seems to have subtly changed.)

16:44.704 --> 16:45.560
(Too bad I failed)

16:45.560 --> 16:47.200
(to use the gray mist's power with it.)

16:47.960 --> 16:49.480
(Going home isn't that easy.)

16:50.640 --> 16:51.920
(I made the talismans.)

16:52.720 --> 16:54.320
(Benson and Melissa both like them.)

16:54.840 --> 16:55.840
(But convincing Melissa)

16:56.160 --> 16:57.888
(they weren't expensive took effort.)

16:59.440 --> 17:01.200
(I have mandatory
mysticism classes daily.)

17:02.240 --> 17:04.400
(Combat training
now includes martial arts too.)

17:05.000 --> 17:06.520
(Just like the military drills.)

17:09.760 --> 17:11.760
(No Beyonder cases
have occurred in Tingen again.)

17:12.480 --> 17:13.560
(It seems peaceful again.)

17:15.000 --> 17:15.872
(Until...)

17:29.000 --> 17:30.600
Tingen City Police discovered

17:31.080 --> 17:33.600
deaths in past two weeks
quintuple normal rates.

17:34.720 --> 17:35.560
Quintuple?

17:37.200 --> 17:38.880
So they handed the cases over to us,

17:39.360 --> 17:40.224
Mandated Punishers,

17:40.560 --> 17:41.520
and Machinery Hivemind.

17:42.419 --> 17:45.920
(In August, over a dozen female workers
died of lead poisoning.)

17:48.979 --> 17:53.696
(11 PM, August 11, arson at West District
poorhouse by bankrupt Thols for revenge)

17:54.880 --> 17:57.696
(10 PM, August 11, Dockworker Zed
drowned himself due to extreme poverty)

17:58.400 --> 18:00.800
Most victims
were low-class workers and vagrants.

18:01.440 --> 18:02.400
They were extremely poor

18:02.520 --> 18:03.520
or suffered from illness.

18:05.108 --> 18:07.808
(8 PM, August 11, Mrs. Lowes, sudden
cardiac death at Lower Iron Cross Street)

18:08.800 --> 18:09.840
Merely surviving

18:10.000 --> 18:11.440
consumes all their energy.

18:12.280 --> 18:13.920
Once ill, death becomes inevitable.

18:15.240 --> 18:16.600
(Just like Klein's mom.)

18:17.920 --> 18:19.680
(If not for Benson's
hard work these years,)

18:20.520 --> 18:21.880
(the Moretti siblings may have)

18:22.640 --> 18:23.680
(the same fate.)

18:38.600 --> 18:39.520
Someone patted them?

18:41.080 --> 18:42.160
Pale and delicate.

18:42.520 --> 18:43.720
Likely a young woman's hand.

18:43.840 --> 18:45.520
This matches our investigation findings.

18:46.360 --> 18:47.720
After excluding natural deaths,

18:48.320 --> 18:49.200
in the other cases,

18:49.800 --> 18:51.720
a young woman's hand
had appeared every time.

18:55.200 --> 18:56.600
(Folan, Captain of Tingen's Mandated Punishers)
Even behind natural death cases

18:57.280 --> 18:59.360
(Sequence 8: Folk of Rage, Sailor Pathway)
lurks the Instigator's possible hand.

18:59.680 --> 19:00.840
Instigator Tris?

19:01.560 --> 19:02.432
Are you suggesting

19:02.600 --> 19:05.040
Tris and that female Beyonder
are working together?

19:05.480 --> 19:06.520
I think

19:06.840 --> 19:09.040
all incidents are likely related
to the Demoness Sect.

19:09.480 --> 19:11.320
(Mrs. Lowes had severe heart disease.)

19:11.920 --> 19:13.320
(Thols went bankrupt months ago)

19:13.760 --> 19:15.640
(and sought revenge
and self-destruction.)

19:16.000 --> 19:17.040
(Zed lived in poverty)

19:17.240 --> 19:18.160
(and sought death.)

19:18.760 --> 19:20.920
(All the victims shared common traits.)

19:21.960 --> 19:23.080
You seem to have noticed it.

19:23.720 --> 19:24.608
Not sharing?

19:26.176 --> 19:27.040
Captain,

19:27.480 --> 19:28.640
Klein and I have a theory.

19:31.600 --> 19:32.560
(This guy...)

19:35.040 --> 19:35.968
In all these cases,

19:36.200 --> 19:37.440
influenced by Beyonders or not,

19:38.240 --> 19:40.320
the victims were fated
to die soon anyway.

19:41.160 --> 19:42.560
But their remaining lifespans

19:43.080 --> 19:44.120
were forcibly cut short.

19:45.000 --> 19:45.920
I suspect

19:46.160 --> 19:47.480
these deaths are cases

19:48.080 --> 19:49.040
of Life Theft.

19:51.720 --> 19:53.800
They aim to use stolen lives
to summon an evil deity,

19:53.984 --> 19:54.848
a demon,

19:55.160 --> 19:56.720
or prepare some horrific,

19:57.000 --> 19:57.960
large-scale curse.

19:59.040 --> 20:01.000
That's the Demoness Sect's
true purpose in Tingen.

20:08.680 --> 20:10.040
Glad we've reached a consensus.

20:10.680 --> 20:12.520
When two protagonists collide,

20:13.000 --> 20:14.960
the wheel of history
begins to turn inexorably.

20:16.384 --> 20:17.248
(Shameless.)

20:18.560 --> 20:19.480
What makes you call

20:19.840 --> 20:20.800
yourself a protagonist?

20:22.520 --> 20:23.840
We both have our secrets.

20:24.520 --> 20:26.640
As long as your actions
don't endanger the Nighthawks,

20:27.168 --> 20:28.080
you'll remain

20:28.080 --> 20:29.240
my comrade-in-arms.

20:29.728 --> 20:30.624
Similarly,

20:31.160 --> 20:32.800
I hope you'll extend me
the same courtesy.

20:35.720 --> 20:37.840
It does match
all characteristics of Life Theft.

20:38.480 --> 20:39.360
Locate the altar

20:39.840 --> 20:40.800
and stop the ritual.

20:41.024 --> 20:41.864
Understood.

20:43.520 --> 20:45.040
This belonged to one of the victims.

20:50.680 --> 20:52.080
The altar's location.

21:10.976 --> 21:11.840
(Got it.)

21:33.960 --> 21:34.880
There's interference.

21:35.440 --> 21:36.920
I can't get a clearer reading.

21:38.000 --> 21:38.848
This is enough.

21:39.720 --> 21:41.720
The criminal's initial targets

21:42.080 --> 21:43.920
would naturally be far
from the ritual site.

21:44.800 --> 21:46.480
It's a basic self-preservation instinct.

21:47.280 --> 21:48.224
Therefore,

21:48.600 --> 21:50.080
if we map the areas of deaths

21:50.400 --> 21:52.280
that spiked dramatically
these past few days,

21:52.960 --> 21:55.320
that leaves us
with the southern industrial zone

21:56.520 --> 21:57.640
and the western district.

22:14.048 --> 22:14.888
This is the place.

22:15.552 --> 22:16.416
I'm certain.

22:18.200 --> 22:19.040
Well done.

22:20.448 --> 22:21.344
I'll draw them

22:21.632 --> 22:22.592
into the dream.

22:23.360 --> 22:24.560
Leonard and Frye attack.

22:28.960 --> 22:29.960
Nightmare.

22:57.560 --> 22:58.520
Concealment.

23:36.760 --> 23:37.664
(Nightmare?)

24:12.704 --> 24:13.568
We're spotted.

24:14.040 --> 24:15.160
The Nightmare was broken.

24:15.872 --> 24:16.832
Stay here.

24:17.240 --> 24:18.640
Do not approach that building.

24:19.360 --> 24:20.480
If there's grave danger,

24:20.576 --> 24:21.504
prioritize retreat.

24:22.048 --> 24:23.040
(Leonard and Frye)

24:23.040 --> 24:24.320
(are Sequence 8 and Sequence 9.)

24:24.320 --> 24:25.184
(They're defeated.)

24:26.080 --> 24:27.640
(Is the target already Sequence 7?)

24:34.440 --> 24:35.296
(Substitution spell?)

24:41.080 --> 24:42.280
Dust falls like snow.

25:12.880 --> 25:15.000
The Source of All Catastrophes.

25:15.840 --> 25:17.840
The Symbol
of Destruction and the Apocalypse.

25:18.680 --> 25:21.600
The Demoness who controls Chaos.

25:23.936 --> 25:24.832
Frye, right side.

25:25.120 --> 25:25.984
Leonard, left side.

25:26.400 --> 25:27.264
Monitor her moves.

25:27.960 --> 25:29.160
Target is at least Sequence 7

25:29.760 --> 25:31.000
and empowered by evil forces.

25:31.488 --> 25:32.352
Be cautious.

25:43.040 --> 25:43.968
Those are...

25:44.384 --> 25:45.240
(Four tiers of spectral monsters)
Shades?

25:45.240 --> 25:46.112
(Lingering Resentment and Grudges,
Shades, Wraiths, and Evil Spirits)

26:43.320 --> 26:44.160
Blood?

26:51.800 --> 26:52.920
(Primordial Demoness.)

26:59.000 --> 27:00.520
Sleepless.

27:57.600 --> 28:00.000
I'll let you be the first lucky one.

28:00.960 --> 28:02.240
Welcome to taste

28:02.960 --> 28:04.560
a Witch's curse.

28:15.560 --> 28:16.560
Black magic?

28:24.480 --> 28:25.520
Bloom.

28:53.040 --> 28:53.888
Farewell.

29:21.840 --> 29:24.800
I pray this mirror
regains temporary restoration

29:25.640 --> 29:27.680
to show everyone
it reflected during the past week.

29:31.520 --> 29:32.560
She looks familiar.

29:36.768 --> 29:37.664
(It's her.)

29:38.016 --> 29:38.976
(Could it be...?)

29:40.280 --> 29:41.600
This female Beyonder

29:41.800 --> 29:42.880
resembles Tris closely.

29:44.000 --> 29:45.080
Any leads on Tris?

29:45.696 --> 29:46.624
The altar downstairs

29:46.624 --> 29:48.880
is a curse ritual
targeting survivors of the Alfalfa.

29:49.920 --> 29:51.160
Tris is the prime suspect.

29:54.200 --> 29:55.600
I suspect this woman

29:56.160 --> 29:57.040
is Tris.

29:58.280 --> 29:59.880
Tris disguised himself as a woman?

30:00.640 --> 30:01.536
No.

30:01.840 --> 30:02.840
He's become a woman.

30:03.232 --> 30:04.128
Exactly.

30:05.000 --> 30:07.760
This perfectly explains
Tris's sudden disappearance.

30:08.560 --> 30:09.600
Become a woman?

30:11.240 --> 30:12.896
It fits the trait
that the Demoness Sect's

30:12.896 --> 30:14.141
upper echelon are all females.

30:16.800 --> 30:17.792
Wait.

30:18.200 --> 30:19.040
So that means

30:19.840 --> 30:21.880
many females
in the Demoness Sect's upper echelon

30:22.560 --> 30:23.560
were once male?

30:27.600 --> 30:29.680
(To master this art,
castrate yourself first?)

30:30.320 --> 30:31.200
(The Demoness Sect)

30:31.480 --> 30:33.280
(has gone to great lengths for power.)

31:17.139 --> 31:20.096
(Trissy, Sequence 7: Witch,
Assassin Pathway)

32:11.795 --> 32:16.976
♪Burn my broken shell to new sight♪

32:17.769 --> 32:25.535
♪To be free in mist
to hold a cup of light♪

32:25.814 --> 32:29.183
♪Where are the flames
that come in fury?♪

32:29.397 --> 32:32.607
♪Where are the keys
that carve truth from me?♪

32:32.821 --> 32:38.399
♪Into the dark
to dream and scream my name♪

32:38.399 --> 32:41.599
♪Wonder or dismay♪

32:41.599 --> 32:45.225
♪Madness or decay♪

32:45.749 --> 32:47.805
♪With fragile light♪

32:47.805 --> 32:51.871
♪I vow to guard a world I stay♪

32:51.871 --> 32:55.534
♪Stirring or delay♪

32:55.534 --> 32:58.847
♪Rebirth or be same♪

32:59.414 --> 33:04.681
♪With whispers in gray
guide my shadow way♪

33:04.950 --> 33:08.511
♪Fade away♪
